00:57:37.050 --> 00:57:43.940
<v David Maxon>For whatever reason, my reaction was to sort of challenge the devil. Come on, bring it on.

00:57:43.940 --> 00:57:56.030
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. We'll be back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:57:56.030 --> 00:58:01.030
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International.
